WEBVTT

00:00:09,230 --> 00:00:12,590
Are you familiar with hoxy biomedical or another hoxy question?

00:00:13,070 --> 00:00:21,390
Hoxy biomedical is the clinic in Mexico that uses hoxy therapy. So they, you could go there and

00:00:21,390 --> 00:00:26,270
get hoxy therapy from their clinic, but they have some other therapies there. I think they could

00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,670
write down there and some other things too. We've had a number of patients that have gone there

00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:39,650
that have liked them, and so it's just another type of therapy that you could do.

